se of these programs.\r\n>  *\r\n>  * This disclaimer of warranty extends to the user of these programs and user's\r\n>  * customers, employees, agents, transferees, successors, and assigns.\r\n>  *\r\n>  * The MPEG Software Simulation Group does not represent or warrant that the\r\n>  * programs furnished hereunder are free of infringement of any third-party\r\n>  * patents.\r\n>  *\r\n>  * Commercial implementations of MPEG-1 and MPEG-2 video, including shareware,\r\n>  * are subject to royalty fees to patent holders.  Many of these patents are\r\n>  * general enough such that they are unavoidable regardless of implementation\r\n>  * design.\r\n> ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1673467503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1673476282","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2049#issuecomment-1673476282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2049","id":1673476282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85jvzi6","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-10T15:42:35Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T15:42:35Z","body":"So this one is interesting. Ordinarily I wouldn't be in favor of adding a warranty disclaimer to the License List if that was all it was, just disclaiming warranties.\r\n\r\nHere, looking at the text, I think that the first sentence is the one that _maybe_ gets me over the line to be on board with including it:\r\n\r\n> These software programs are available to the user without any license fee or royalty on an \"as is\" basis.\r\n\r\nIs that a broad enough statement to qualify as a \"license\"? I'm not sure. I note that the second paragraph does refer to the user's \"customers\" and \"transferees\", apparently implying that the \"user\" is permitted to reproduce and distribute the code.\r\n\r\nThis isn't how I would draft a \"license\" statement  :)  but given its use in Fedora, I can get over my hesitancy about how it is drafted. The intent does appear to be to permit use and redistribution of the code.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1673476282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1673477145","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2049#issuecomment-1673477145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2049","id":1673477145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85jvzwZ","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":